
@1=~It's a shame you didn't shed a single tear of blood, I could have helped you...~
@2=~Know that the final test awaits you behind this door, and I don't give much for your chances.~
@3=~Farewell, Blood of Bhaal! (His eyes close)~ 
@4=~What a fine run! Know that the final test awaits you behind this door, and unfortunately, you will fail. A most deadly failure, in fact...~
@5=~There won't be much left when they're done with you. (smiles)~
@6=~What's behind this door?~ 
@7=~And may we know why?~
@8=~I don't think I asked for your opinion, stone-faced.~
@9=~(continues without listening)~
@10=~Excellent question. What's next?~
@11=~You don't possess the proper equipment, but I am able to turn the situation to your advantage. Know that I don't work for free.~
@12=~Continue, stone face.~ 
@13=~Nice try, but you won't get anything from me.~ 
@14=~That's right, I've never been able to keep my mouth shut, but it would be a shame for you to end this brilliant adventure like this.~ 
@15=~Give me a tear of blood, and I will help you emerge victorious.~ 
@16=~My tear of blood is not for sale.~
@17=~My tears of blood are not for sale.~
@18=~I don't need help to defeat my enemies.~
@19=~(You give him the Tanari's tear of blood)~ 
@20=~(You give him the Bone Golem's tear of blood)~ 
@21=~(You give him the Spectator's tear of blood)~ 
@22=~(You give him Islendra's tear of blood)~
@23=~(You give him the (Tear of Taguar's Blood)~
@24=~(You give him Kael's Tear of Blood)~ 
@25=~(You give him Disease's Tear of Blood)~ 
@26=~You will regret your choice. Nevertheless, I wish you good luck.~
@27=~Farewell, Blood of Bhaal (his eyes close).~ 
@28=~You will regret your choice. Nevertheless, I wish you good luck.~ 
@29=~Farewell, Blood of Bhaal (his eyes close).~ 
@30=~The most important thing is to win, and all help is welcome.~
@31=~You will regret your choice, nevertheless, I wish you good luck.~ 
@32=~Farewell, Blood of Bhaal (his eyes close).~ 
@33=~(Stone arms emerge from the walls under Heras's eager gaze). He contemplates the stone with a very satisfied expression.~ 
